    "detailed_description": "Tomb is an action/adventure game including exploration &amp; discovery, platforming, and puzzle solving, fun fast-paced combat.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206130/extras/d0656b796dd556737c546338056b3675.poster.avif?t=1710877489\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206130/extras/d0656b796dd556737c546338056b3675.webm?t=1710877489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206130/extras/d0656b796dd556737c546338056b3675.mp4?t=1710877489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>At the core Tomb is a tight run &amp; gun shooter that will test your skill, timing, reflexes. Building upon that solid arcade base, the game adds a ton of crazy weapons.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206130/extras/ea2a8889e37b943cd4480ff4f3851d4a.poster.avif?t=1710877489\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206130/extras/ea2a8889e37b943cd4480ff4f3851d4a.webm?t=1710877489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206130/extras/ea2a8889e37b943cd4480ff4f3851d4a.mp4?t=1710877489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206130/extras/a0fd5662c1e8a2eb0f28c14d7a1d0407.avif?t=1710877489\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206130/extras/55280b2db29d88e773e86a88ed7bfa78.poster.avif?t=1710877489\" ><source src=\"https://shared.ak